  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">這個模組將貓頭鷹加入遊戲中！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">牠們會生成在森林生態域中。（在 Forge 版本中，你可以透過編輯 data 資料夾中的 biome tags 和 biome modifier JSON 檔案來調整生成設定；而在 Fabric 版本中則有專屬設定檔）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">牠們的運作方式與鸚鵡相同。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">你可以使用種子來馴服牠們（從 1.21.5 版本開始改為使用肉類）</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">並用唱片機讓牠們嗨起來。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">牠們還能停在你的肩膀上稍作休息，並有兩種外觀變化。（根據寒冷/溫暖生態域而定）</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">目前支援的模組載入器版本</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Forge&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 26.x | 1.21.11 | 1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.7 | 1.21.6 | 1.12.5 | 1.21.4 | 1.21.1 | 1.20.1 | 1.19.2</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Fabric&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;26.x | 1.21.11 | 1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.7 | 1.21.6 | 1.21.5 | 1.21.4 | 1.21.1 | 1.20.1</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>NeoForge 26.x | 1.21.11 | 1.21.10 | 1.21.9 | 1.21.8 | 1.21.4 | 1.21.1</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><em><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1184/731/logo.jpg\" width=\"777\" height=\"777\"></em></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f60\"><strong>若你需要其他版本的模組，或是在 CurseForge 上遇到任何錯誤，請傳送私人訊息給我</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#f60\"><a style=\"color:#f60\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/aquarius_playz/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/aquarius_playz/projects</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#00f\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#00f\"><strong>在 X（Twitter）上追蹤我</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#00f\"><a style=\"color:#00f\" href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://x.com/Aquarius_playz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://x.com/Aquarius_playz</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquarius-libs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1577/494/639022024300181764.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\"></a></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\"><a style=\"color:#f00;font-size:18px\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aquarius-libs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>此模組需要安裝 AquariusLibs 才能運作</strong></a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
